[{"id":"cnm_150_q1","topicId":"cnm_150","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"x²-1=(x+1)(x-1) 是因式分解吗？","answer":"C","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"不是，因为这是整式乘法"},{"key":"B","text":"不是，因为等号两边不相等"},{"key":"C","text":"是，因为把多项式化成了几个整式的积"},{"key":"D","text":"不是，因为右边没有化成一个多项式"}],"explanation":"因式分解是把一个多项式化成几个整式的积，右边正是整式的积的形式。"},{"id":"cnm_150_q2","topicId":"cnm_150","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下列从左到右的变形，属于因式分解的是：","answer":"B","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"x(x+1)=x²+x"},{"key":"B","text":"x²-4=(x+2)(x-2)"},{"key":"C","text":"x²+2x+1=x(x+2)+1"},{"key":"D","text":"(x+1)(x-1)=x²-1"}],"explanation":"因式分解的结果必须是几个整式的积；A、D 是整式乘法，C 的右边还有加号，不是积的形式。"},{"id":"cnm_150_q3","topicId":"cnm_150","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"下面四个变形：(1) a(a+1)=a²+a；(2) a²-1=(a+1)(a-1)；(3) a²+2a+1=a(a+2)+1；(4) 2a²-2a=2a(a-1)。其中属于因式分解的有几个？（填数字）","answer":"2","explanation":"(2)(4) 是把多项式化成整式的积，属于因式分解；(1) 是整式乘法，(3) 右边不是积的形式。","verify":"sum([0,1,0,1])"},{"id":"cnm_150_q4","topicId":"cnm_150","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"若 x²+px+q=(x+2)(x-5)，求 p、q 的值（依次作答，用逗号隔开）。","answer":"-3，-10","explanation":"(x+2)(x-5)=x²-3x-10，对比得 p=-3，q=-10。因式分解与整式乘法互为逆运算。","verify":"[2+(-5), 2*(-5)]"},{"id":"cnm_155_q1","topicId":"cnm_155","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"计算 57²-43²。（可用因式分解简便计算）","answer":"1400","explanation":"57²-43²=(57+43)(57-43)=100×14=1400。","verify":"57**2-43**2"},{"id":"cnm_155_q2","topicId":"cnm_155","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"计算 3.14×7+3.14×3 的值。","answer":"31.4","explanation":"提公因式：3.14×(7+3)=3.14×10=31.4。","verify":"Fraction(314,100)*10"},{"id":"cnm_155_q3","topicId":"cnm_155","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"已知 x²-y²=24，x+y=6，求 x-y 的值。","answer":"4","explanation":"x²-y²=(x+y)(x-y)，所以 6(x-y)=24，x-y=4。","verify":"24//6"},{"id":"cnm_155_q4","topicId":"cnm_155","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"已知 a+b=3，ab=2，求 2a²b+2ab² 的值。","answer":"12","explanation":"2a²b+2ab²=2ab(a+b)=2×2×3=12。","verify":"2*2*3"},{"id":"cnm_155_q5","topicId":"cnm_155","difficulty":"advanced","type":"choice","prompt":"n 为整数，则 (n+3)²-n² 一定能被下列哪个数整除？","answer":"D","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"2"},{"key":"B","text":"6"},{"key":"C","text":"9"},{"key":"D","text":"3"}],"explanation":"(n+3)²-n²=(n+3+n)(n+3-n)=3(2n+3)，一定是 3 的倍数；2n+3 是奇数且不一定是 3 的倍数，故不一定被 2、6、9 整除。"}]
